<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi authorities are moving to disarm and integrate PKK-linked Yazidi militias, including YBŞ and YJŞ, into the Iraqi army and interior ministry, while pledging protection of Yazidi rights and Mount Shengal. The government also removed intelligence chief Hamid al-Shatri and a court ordered the arrest of the Maysan council chief, and parliament approved most remaining cabinet posts, some held by Iran-backed militia figures. Saudi, Turkish and Pakistani officials are preparing talks with Iran amid Houthi attacks. The conflict produced 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9OeTc1VE5lcEx0QzNhVlh6TnBVZUhfdi1MR0xZQnJOLWo2U3dHb09ucVhPNXctSTFXNTF6R3EwZEJXSl96SF9zS2FPUWFwcHpHeFVMaGtUckZiaGIydHc1SFMwT3U1R1h5WnMtY2RGUkdtYm1jV2VUMWFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Long War Journal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE1QNGxvOEJid2FpVWk0V2lVNnZqV2V0bi11UEtHTTdUSFQ1cE5WQ3VzNjVOVVVLa2puMXVDd0oyRkpKVVIzS3Y1SFdpV29Pa2R2blJlc2lEbjZ4V1hjR01GNGN3MWFSRVE1WGVZSnBmXzhnbGNnNnlIWGNEbjAzZGM?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTE9LNGZwNHotcG5yZS14VkNmbXRlVDYxQmFIcGhjYktvM0pJWXp3ZHZTX05hVVZQaDRCcFRSN1FPZjhpUnVmNmpGMDE1SmZrdDM2M1ZOYXV3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ynetnews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxORWVtQWVFaXp3MUVEQU5sSDNKQ2tnQVdmNTRITlZzSGZyMlktNkdacG95NU1TVEJSanRUM3NOajlYN0toMF9sVjQ5QjJGb2NFbDdVck1ORHI0UGMzOFZiT1FHckQzU2c0WWs4amhrU0ZuVmFrVFFaaldyTS1CMnRQUk1Ga0FKNEgxZ2FxajZod2h0T2tUakpSczFQbkdmQUZwM011T01OWWwydw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ANF English&lt;/a&gt